 The department is strengthening its strategic tactical and support focus. This includes a stronger position in national and European educational and research policy developments, increased expertise in quality management and accreditation, and a clearer distinction between external strategic advisory responsibilities and the internal support of our educational organisation.
 As Manager Education & Research Support, you have an important role in this development. Alongside your responsibility for leading the department, you will increasingly focus on the external strategic positioning of Hotelschool The Hague, developments in European and international higher education and research, strategic partnerships, and opportunities for external funding.
 General function description 
 As Manager Education & Research Support, you fulfil a strategic and integral role in supporting and realising Hotelschool The Hague's education and research strategy. You advise the Board of Directors and Education & Research management and safeguard the coherence, quality, and further development of policies, processes, and programmes relating to education, research, accreditation, and subsidy management.
