eurofins:744000156511410.description:
JOB DESCRIPTION:
For our location in Leiden, we are looking for an enthusiastic Pilot Plant Buffer & Media Operator to join a new team.
 In this position you will be part of a production operations team that produces end-to-end clinical material for advanced therapies, specially focused on cell and gene therapies. This includes production of media & buffers, cell banks, starting material like virus seeds and plasmids, API and DS for several different modalities.
 You will be required to adhere to GxP guidelines and for some activities you will be required to enter clean rooms. Your activities will include:
 Production of a wide range of buffers and media for both GMP and non-GMP applications.
 Buffer/Media Preparation on scales ranging from 10 ml to 200L.
 Supporting the introduction of new buffers for new processes.
 Supporting the equipment & material introduction for new buffers and processes.
